-- `...` is an `ellipsis` only as the first token of a hole opened in a tag
-- (frontend.md §9.1). Later in such a hole, in a children hole, and in
-- ordinary code `...a` lexes as it always did, `dot_dot` then `.a`: the
-- markup is not_implemented at 6:5 and the code unexpected_token at 10:7.
view a =
    <Card {a ...a}>{...a}</Card>


plain a =
    a ...a
